<LanguageData>

  <!-- EN: FPV drone hive -->
  <DMS_FPVNest.label>FPV無人機母巢</DMS_FPVNest.label>
  <!-- EN: A garrison drone nest built from sealed pioneer patterns. Load it with steel and it assembles wildfowl, coaxial-rotor suicide drones that hunt down hostiles and detonate against them, and launches them in salvos of up to four.\n\nUnlike the facility nests still guarding this world's installations, it has no underground logistics line to restock it, so it must be fed by hand. Recalled drones return their steel; drones that run their batteries flat are lost. -->
  <DMS_FPVNest.description>一種依照先鋒封存型號建造的駐屯無人機巢。裝填鋼鐵後，它會組裝野禽無人機，一種會主動追獵敵人並在接觸時引爆的共軸旋翼自殺無人機，每批最多可發射四架。\n\n與至今仍守在這顆星球各處設施的同型機巢不同，它沒有地下物流線替它補給，只能靠人手裝填。收回的無人機會退還鋼鐵，電池耗盡的無人機則會直接損失。</DMS_FPVNest.description>

</LanguageData>
